# a4091: its .moddata keys (amix-dlm C3-1 section 3, C4-2 section 1 and the
# A4091 row of section 8) and the definition line, as the ABI kit's mkmod
# reads a Master.  One Master for both lines: no $cpu, the kit's fragment gives
# the line's (68030 on k30, 68040 on k46); kabi and cc come from the kit.
# $class root: loaded by the core's root pass (marc_root) before the root is
# mounted; a root-class module is never unloaded ($unload never).
# $match: the A4091 (Commodore 0202:54), the A4092 (c0de:01) and the A4770
# (c0de:02, as driver.conf has it; untested on hardware).
# $rank zorro: sd's class 2 (C4-1 section 4), the argument a4091_load passes
# to sd_register.  No $majors: sd owns the disk majors.
# $modtype misc: MOD_HDRV_WRAPPER, no switch-table slot.
$modtype misc
$class root
$match zorro:0202:54,zorro:c0de:01,zorro:c0de:02
$rank zorro
$unload never
$desc A4091/A4092/A4770 SCSI (NCR 53C710), root-class disk controller
a4091	a4091
